  "pichi": {
    "title": "Hi, I'm Pichi",
    "whoTitle": "Who is Pichi?",
    "who": [
      "Pichi started as a meme. A reporter in Serbia asked a little boy playing in the snow what he was sliding on, and he said proudly: “This is a pičiguz.” In English, it sounds just like “peachy goose,” and we spelled it our way: Pichigoose. He meant the plastic seat you sit on to slide down a snowy hill.",
      "Somehow that one word made the whole country smile. It found us at a time when we really needed a smile, and it stayed."
    ],
    "whyTitle": "Why Pichigoose",
    "why": [
      "Pichigoose began as my bullet journal. Then Danko and I moved in together, and there was so much we wanted to do that it all got a little overwhelming.",
      "Danko is handy and always building something. I write everything down. We wanted one calm place to share it all, without spamming each other. If it's in the app, we'll get to it eventually."
    ],
    "usTitle": "Who made it",
    "us": [
      "Nora and Danko. We're in love with each other, and with this perfect thing called life. We're excited about every chapter, and we want it to be as stress-free as possible.",
      "We hope Pichigoose brings a little joy to your home, like it did to ours."
    ],
    "footer": "© 2026 Pichigoose",
    "pageTitle": "About Pichigoose: who Pichi is and who made the app",
    "about": "About Pichigoose",
    "watching": "Keeping an eye on",
    "low": "Running low"
  },
